  - `href("/products/*", { "*": "/1/edit" }); // -> /products/1/edit`
- `@react-router/architect` - Update `@architect/functions` from `^5.2.0` to `^7.0.0` ([#13556](https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/13556))
